  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  English: 'HEY!\n

    Thank you for being a playtester for Corrosion!!\n

    There
    is more content for you to explore such as the original tutorial level (kinda
    annoying i dont recommend) and a developer scene with some not yet used content
    inside. You can also use the developer menu to switch to some of the not yet
    finished weapons. Finally there is a practice mode you can use to upgrade the
    weapon you are currently using (This is procedurally generated and is my favorite
    part of the game)

    THANK YOU FOR PLAYING!!!!!!!!!

    (you might have to
    press pause to get the mouse back.......)/n

    dev pass :: qoh1206'
